data: {"id": "e62b59ea89f24342-thinking-parallel_evidence-2141", "run_id": "e62b59ea89f24342", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "---\n\n## 证据汇总与因果分析\n\n### 支持证据\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n| **kubectl describe** | Last State: Terminated, Reason=`OOMKilled`, Exit Code=`137` |\n| **kubectl get yaml** | containerStatus: restarts=3, exitCode=137, reason=CrashLoopBackOff |\n| **Prometheus Metrics** | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` = `OOMKilled`；`restarts_total` = 2 (describe 显示 3，metric 可能尚未同步最新一次) |\n| **kubectl previous logs** | 仅一行 `\"startup allocation 256Mi\"` — 进程启动后立即申请 256Mi 内存后被 OOMKilled |\n| **Pod Command", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789378101556, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

