data: {"id": "e62b59ea89f24342-final", "run_id": "e62b59ea89f24342", "seq": 2146, "ts_ms": 1789378118090, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Container memory limit (64Mi) is significantly lower than the application's memory allocation (256Mi), triggering OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) and CrashLoopBackOff. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 等待原因为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，最后终止原因为 `OOMKilled` | 定位应用反复崩溃的直接状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 退出码为 `137` | 确认进程被系统强制终止（OOM Killer 行为） |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 内存硬限制（resource_limit.memory）为 `64Mi` | 提供资源限制事实，构成根因的必要条件 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 状态为 `Running`，但 `ContainersReady` 和 `Ready` 均为 `False` | 确认 Pod 处于无法提供服务的异常运行态 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 应用日志消息显示：`startup allocation 256Mi` | 提供应用内存诉求事实，证实资源限制（64Mi）显著低于预期 |\n| 6 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | 事件消息：`Back-off restarting failed container app` (发生 8 次) | 印证 CrashLoopBackOff 机制及重启频率 |\n| 7 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` 标签为 `OOMKilled` (值为 1) | 独立于 K8s API 确认终止原因 |\n\n**证据印证：**\n- **内存限制冲突**：K8s 配置显示内存硬限制为 `64Mi` [3]，而应用日志明确表明其启动分配的内存为 `256Mi` [5]。这一量级差异直接证实了 OOM（内存不足）发生的物理基础。\n- **OOM 确认闭环**：应用日志的内存分配 [5] 与 K8s 状态 [1, 2] 及 Prometheus 指标 [7] 均指向 `OOMKilled` 及退出码 `137`，证实应用因内存不足被系统强杀，进而触发重启并进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态 [1, 6]。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制 (64Mi) 远低于应用实际诉求 (256Mi) → OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) → 触发 K8s 重启与退避逻辑 (BackOff) → Pod 持续处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 (ContainersNotReady)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**容器内存配置严重不足**。\n\nKubernetes 集群中 `aiops-case-v15/workload` 的 `app` 容器被强制设置了 `64Mi` 的内存硬限制，但应用启动时实际需求 `256Mi` 内存。这一配置缺陷导致进程在启动后瞬间触发 OOM Killer，被操作系统强制终止（Exit Code 137）。Kubernetes 检测到容器非正常退出后，触发指数退避重试机制，最终表现为容器长期处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 50.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v15/workload: 50.0s (Evidence 44.0s, RCA 5.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v15/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 87.254, "metrics": {"run_id": "e62b59ea89f24342", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 87.25341773033142, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 87253.41773033142, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 80779.48188781738, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 17177.070379257202, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5902.928590774536}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 26781.259775161743, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 50003.72385978699, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10440.784931182861, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

